 136:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h **** /**
 137:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * Undo the alpha scaling of a premultiplied pixel, giving back a straight color.
 138:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * Shared so the output formats that need it can't drift apart.
 139:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * @param c     a premultiplied pixel
 140:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/sw/blend/lv_draw_sw_blend_private.h ****  * @return      the same pixel with straight channels
